# A page whose ticket hasn't landed (source/screens/nav.c): A on Settings
# (LEFT twice from the carousel's first item) fades home out and the page in
# (every frame hashed): its title bar with the item's icon and name, an
# empty card, and B back in the hint bar. B fades back to home, facing the
# item.
-w "nav: home ready"
-k @8:LEFT -k @12:- -k @16:LEFT -k @20:-
-k @36:A -k @40:-
-H @36:@58
-w "nav: page settings ready"
-s @1:page.png
-k @8:B -k @12:-
-w "nav: home ready"
-s @1:back.png
